# tuning_data/ holds digests of level-PI tuning bags — small JSON
# summaries + downsampled CSV timeseries written by
# stewart_bringup/scripts/analyze_level_bag.py.
#
# Block everything by default, then re-allow only the file types we
# expect. This makes it impossible to accidentally commit a raw
# rosbag2 SQLite/MCAP into the repo, no matter what someone runs.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*.json
!*.csv
